Spec: SpecDD PSI File

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Represent SpecDD files in IntelliJ PSI.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDPsiFile.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDPsiFile.kt

Can read:
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDLanguageBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Extend IntelliJ `PsiFileBase`.
  Use `SpecDDLanguage`.
  Return a `SpecDDFileType` file type.
  Delegate `findReferenceAt` to the path reference concern so Go to Declaration can resolve paths in minimal PSI files.
  Use `SpecDD file` as the debug string.

Must not:
  Define parsing behavior.
  Define syntax highlighting behavior.
  Define validation diagnostics.
